      "created_at": "2018-09-13T18:57:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This group and the Visitors have been a four team. &nbsp;However, the Starter Kit and Stolen Legacy have six and five heroes respectively. &nbsp; Any reason why it was chosen to do groups of four for these?</p>",
