      "id": 222216,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-13T19:45:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think the fact that there are 5 or 6 heroes available for those adventures means that's the ideal number, just the maximum number.&nbsp; Four seems to be the default assumption for the RPG's I know of (adjust up for more players, down for fewer).&nbsp; It's a good number for shows, too--already the 4 players in Paul's game talk over each other sometimes.&nbsp; More would be hard to follow.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:06.215Z",
