    {
      "id": 222217,
      "name": "degausser",
      "username": "degausser",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-13T22:38:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I enjoyed it. &nbsp;I thought I was gonna hate Bubbles as a concept (not Jodi) but the whole team ended up turning out really well. &nbsp;I’m kind of sad that Hourly Rage didn’t greatest hits ‘The Final Countdown’ when Mishap was disarming the bomb. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Overall this season is shaping up to be more ‘Superhero-ey’ than the first season. &nbsp;When I think superheroes, I think Jetpack-Laser squad, not weird cosmic space dragons. &nbsp;I liked season 1, don’t get me wrong, just, this season seems more in line with typical superhero stuff. . . Minus the (apparent) six year old and 40 year old wheelchair-bound hippie artist.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:06.280Z",
