      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-13T23:18:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I love how, during character creation, Chris was just like, \"Well, here's a buttload of obscure Sentinels canon that will define my character!\" Like, I'm not sure anyone else in the room was following him. XD</p>\n<p>I love Mishap's design, though. I think Hourly Rage might be my fan fave, however. Rock bard!</p>",
