      "created_at": "2018-09-17T19:19:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>@TakeWalker</p>\n<p>Yeah, Chris is definitely the person in the office besides Christopher and Adam who knows the most obscure SC canon lol</p>\n<p>@Powerhound_2000</p>\n<p>We decided to do 4 characters because that is how many we can reasonably fit at our table while filming everyone. My actual preference for RPGs is to have 5 players.</p>",
