      "created_at": "2018-10-11T15:16:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>(Note - still haven't watched the final 2 episodes.)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Bubbles and Concept Artist were pretty good at handling ranged stuff and being defensive when needed. And Mishap was great at destroying lots of innocent pinecone people from a distance. Errr. Ummm. Yeah.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You're right about the team lacking in investigative abilities. My own gaming group (Torg Eternity right now, but we'd be playing SCRPG if we had a copy) has nobody with any investigative skills and only one person who's any good at talking to people. It's proving to be a challenge.</p>\n<p>In any game where there aren't obivious roles to fill (like supers), it's not always obvious when there's a gap in the group's skillset until it's too late.&nbsp;</p>",
